WEBVTT

01:36.009 --> 01:40.740
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.520 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 4]

01:44.120 --> 01:45.150
If we had taken Zhennan Pass,

01:45.150 --> 01:47.039
our next move
would've been to march into the city.

01:47.039 --> 01:47.840
The fact that Jinxiu was able to

01:47.840 --> 01:48.640
mobilize all forces

01:48.640 --> 01:49.400
instantly

01:49.870 --> 01:50.509
proves that the city

01:50.509 --> 01:51.509
was already heavily fortified.

01:51.509 --> 01:52.509
If we had entered,

01:52.509 --> 01:54.120
they only needed to close the gates,

01:54.120 --> 01:55.000
and our entire army

01:55.000 --> 01:57.800
would've been
slaughtered with no burial ground.

01:57.950 --> 01:58.680
According to

01:58.680 --> 01:59.410
your theory,

01:59.640 --> 02:00.560
Fu Yixiao's arrow

02:00.560 --> 02:01.310
wasn't a disaster at all,

02:01.310 --> 02:02.350
but actually saved us?

02:02.350 --> 02:03.660
Otherwise, as someone
who has rendered meritorious service,

02:03.660 --> 02:04.630
why would her own people

02:04.630 --> 02:05.710
want to kill her?

02:05.730 --> 02:06.760
The fact that Jinxiu knew

02:06.760 --> 02:07.900
our retreat route

02:08.150 --> 02:08.840
can only mean

02:08.840 --> 02:10.870
someone in Susha
is collaborating with the enemy.

02:10.870 --> 02:11.800
Someone has leaked

02:11.800 --> 02:13.060
our military secrets.

02:13.470 --> 02:15.310
The person who wanted to kill Fu Yixiao

02:15.310 --> 02:16.070
is most likely

02:16.070 --> 02:17.960
the traitor
who's collaborating with the enemy.

02:17.960 --> 02:19.280
That's not necessarily true,

02:19.280 --> 02:20.610
but it's a possibility.

02:20.680 --> 02:21.800
The motive for killing Fu Yixiao

02:21.800 --> 02:22.520
may well be that

02:22.520 --> 02:23.750
she had uncovered some secret.

02:23.750 --> 02:24.630
So Fu Yixiao

02:24.630 --> 02:25.590
had uncovered some secret,

02:25.590 --> 02:26.960
and someone wanted to silence her?

02:26.960 --> 02:27.750
Anyway, this matter

02:27.750 --> 02:28.690
concerns us.

02:28.800 --> 02:29.630
As long as we find out

02:29.630 --> 02:30.630
who wants to kill Fu Yixiao,

02:30.630 --> 02:32.860
we can follow the clues

02:32.960 --> 02:34.730
to uncover the traitor in Susha.

02:34.730 --> 02:35.390
Oh, come on!

02:35.390 --> 02:36.470
Do we even need to investigate?

02:36.470 --> 02:37.000
It's most likely

02:37.000 --> 02:38.470
that old scoundrel Prime Minister Zhuang.

02:38.470 --> 02:39.430
Do you have any evidence?

02:39.430 --> 02:41.030
I... I'm not afraid of him...

02:45.590 --> 02:47.050
I'm sorry, Your Highness.

02:47.150 --> 02:48.079
I got so into thinking of
this place as a military camp

02:48.079 --> 02:50.150
that I forgot about you
while we were talking.

02:50.150 --> 02:50.840
Your Highness.

02:50.840 --> 02:52.460
What should we do next?

02:52.800 --> 02:54.860
The people who have been following us

02:55.310 --> 02:57.150
must have reached Yujing by now.

02:57.710 --> 02:59.040
We were being followed?

03:00.560 --> 03:01.820
How did I not know that?

03:02.360 --> 03:03.630
Your Highness, are you referring to

03:03.630 --> 03:04.560
those injured soldiers from Jinxiu

03:04.560 --> 03:05.280
whom we saw

03:05.310 --> 03:06.970
when we left Zhengnian Villa?

03:07.280 --> 03:09.000
Treat guests with hospitality.

03:09.000 --> 03:10.260
Take good care of them.

03:21.560 --> 03:22.420
Your Highness.

03:23.079 --> 03:24.840
Physician Xu, what are your chances

03:24.840 --> 03:25.640
of curing her?

03:26.190 --> 03:27.840
The lady's meridians are damaged.

03:27.840 --> 03:28.980
A full recovery

03:29.079 --> 03:30.780
will be extremely difficult.

03:31.400 --> 03:33.030
I have less than

03:33.079 --> 03:34.430
a 30% chance of success.

03:41.630 --> 03:42.960
What if we add this?

03:50.150 --> 03:51.060
Your Highness.

03:51.350 --> 03:53.430
This is really good for external injuries

03:53.430 --> 03:54.800
and might do wonders

03:54.870 --> 03:56.260
for your arrow wound.

03:56.400 --> 03:57.680
But for the lady's

03:57.800 --> 03:58.930
damaged meridians,

03:59.030 --> 04:00.470
it won't be of much help.

04:00.520 --> 04:02.560
Besides, this belongs to
the Second Prince...

04:02.560 --> 04:03.680
My brother gave it to me,

04:03.680 --> 04:04.590
so it's mine.

04:05.190 --> 04:06.430
What's mine is hers.

04:06.710 --> 04:08.640
Give her the best medicine we have.

04:11.310 --> 04:12.150
In short,

04:16.720 --> 04:19.000
you must heal my beloved concubine's

04:19.000 --> 04:20.120
hand injury.

04:23.510 --> 04:24.070
Yes.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.160
My dear.

04:30.620 --> 04:32.370
My dear. Don't be angry.

04:32.750 --> 04:34.730
Though you're called a concubine,

04:35.120 --> 04:36.860
you are the only woman

04:37.570 --> 04:39.100
in my household.

04:50.750 --> 04:52.300
Why would I be angry?

04:52.750 --> 04:54.430
I'm so happy.

04:54.850 --> 04:55.780
However,

04:56.310 --> 04:58.050
if you give all your medicine to me,

04:58.050 --> 04:59.750
what will you do for yourself?

05:00.040 --> 05:01.270
Your arrow wound

05:01.300 --> 05:02.940
hasn't healed yet, has it?

05:03.630 --> 05:06.650
Let me check it for you.

05:12.640 --> 05:13.790
Then I shall

05:14.240 --> 05:15.920
also take a good look at

05:15.920 --> 05:17.230
your hand injury.

05:20.000 --> 05:20.950
How's that?

05:27.890 --> 05:29.860
You two, escort Physician Xu out.

05:31.740 --> 05:32.620
-Yes.
-Yes.

05:40.370 --> 05:41.770
Thank you, Physician Xu.

05:52.280 --> 05:53.350
Don't look at me.

05:53.480 --> 05:54.430
I know nothing.

05:58.820 --> 06:00.950
I didn't mishear, did I?

06:01.300 --> 06:02.630
Nah, you heard it right!

06:03.110 --> 06:04.770
He said "beloved concubine".

06:04.950 --> 06:05.510
You have to admit that

06:05.510 --> 06:07.160
unmarried noble ladies

06:07.180 --> 06:08.750
are too quiet and refined.

06:08.970 --> 06:10.710
They certainly can't match
this female general from the enemy state

06:10.710 --> 06:12.440
in terms of vigor and vitality.

06:13.670 --> 06:15.330
His Highness has such tastes.

06:16.270 --> 06:17.160
How do you know so much about

06:17.160 --> 06:18.690
His Highness's preferences?

06:18.690 --> 06:19.700
You don't know?

06:21.160 --> 06:22.570
How would I know?

06:24.000 --> 06:25.360
Do you remember His Highness asked me

06:25.360 --> 06:27.960
to find someone
to paint Fu Yixiao's portrait?

06:30.120 --> 06:32.000
That portrait was painted by me

06:32.000 --> 06:33.950
based on His Highness's descriptions.

06:33.950 --> 06:34.800
Think about it.

06:34.800 --> 06:36.390
Who would describe their enemy

06:36.390 --> 06:37.240
in such detail,

06:37.240 --> 06:38.070
vivid

06:38.090 --> 06:39.690
and heroically impressive?

06:40.350 --> 06:41.880
There were signs all along.

06:42.480 --> 06:44.080
We just realized it too late.

06:44.490 --> 06:45.470
But it does

06:45.800 --> 06:46.870
seem to make sense.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.560
What cooperation?

06:56.190 --> 06:57.990
You're clearly humiliating me!

06:58.159 --> 06:59.630
I don't have time for that.

07:01.950 --> 07:03.230
Giving you the title of concubine

07:03.230 --> 07:04.460
is to protect you.

07:04.680 --> 07:06.600
I don't have many women in my mansion.

07:06.600 --> 07:07.510
Your sudden appearance

07:07.510 --> 07:09.240
will surely arouse suspicion.

07:09.270 --> 07:10.930
I don't need your protection.

07:11.040 --> 07:13.480
I sincerely cooperate with you,

07:14.000 --> 07:15.800
so you'd better play along.

07:16.630 --> 07:19.430
I also sincerely cooperate
with the First Prince,

07:19.510 --> 07:21.310
but I won't play along with you.

07:27.680 --> 07:28.540
Your Highness.

07:31.040 --> 07:31.600
Come in.

07:40.950 --> 07:42.570
As a member of my household,

07:42.870 --> 07:44.600
those clothes simply won't do.

07:45.080 --> 07:46.480
Take good care of my wife.

07:46.800 --> 07:47.560
Yes.

07:50.190 --> 07:51.000
My lady,

07:51.270 --> 07:52.390
let me help you change your clothes.

07:52.390 --> 07:52.930
Get out.

07:53.060 --> 07:54.320
I don't need to change.

07:54.480 --> 07:55.250
My lady.

07:55.360 --> 07:57.310
I am here to serve you by order.

07:57.330 --> 07:58.930
I don't need your service.

07:59.040 --> 08:00.370
If we leave like this,

08:00.480 --> 08:01.640
we'll be punished.

08:01.720 --> 08:02.310
Get out!

08:02.460 --> 08:04.590
Don't you understand what I'm saying?

08:04.950 --> 08:05.630
My lady,

08:05.680 --> 08:07.000
please change your clothes,

08:07.000 --> 08:08.970
or we'll have to kneel until you do.

08:11.680 --> 08:12.360
My lady,

08:12.630 --> 08:14.230
please change your clothes.

08:15.000 --> 08:15.560
Fine.

08:16.720 --> 08:17.270
Hurry up.

08:20.530 --> 08:22.360
I'll do it myself.
Don't remove my leg wraps.

08:22.360 --> 08:23.240
Who wears leg wraps

08:23.240 --> 08:24.390
under their clothes?

08:24.390 --> 08:24.990
My lady,

08:25.040 --> 08:26.310
let me serve you.

08:26.310 --> 08:27.460
I'll do it myself.

08:27.630 --> 08:28.400
Don't move!

08:29.310 --> 08:31.040
Can't you hear what I'm saying?

08:31.390 --> 08:32.750
Don't touch me!

08:35.000 --> 08:40.750
[Wutong Mansion]

09:00.090 --> 09:03.420
[Wutong Mansion]

09:03.910 --> 09:05.600
Dressing me up like this ridiculous doll,

09:05.600 --> 09:06.860
are you satisfied now?

09:07.320 --> 09:08.000
My dear.

09:08.840 --> 09:10.240
What do you want to do?

09:19.550 --> 09:21.080
Taking you out for a stroll.

09:22.000 --> 09:22.630
In such a hurry

09:22.630 --> 09:24.130
to show me off to others,

09:24.490 --> 09:25.760
what if I refuse?

09:30.170 --> 09:35.780
[Wutong Mansion]

09:32.390 --> 09:34.280
Three Tianshan Snow Lotus plants.

09:34.280 --> 09:35.850
Ten lingzhi mushrooms.

09:36.080 --> 09:37.910
Two jin of cordyceps.

09:37.910 --> 09:40.090
Five jin of tribute Saffron flowers.

09:40.200 --> 09:41.690
Various amounts of northern saposhnikovia.

09:41.690 --> 09:42.810
Western ginseng.

09:43.600 --> 09:44.460
Your Highness,

09:44.480 --> 09:46.510
Physician Xu is being too demanding.

09:46.510 --> 09:47.390
What kind of illness is it?

09:47.390 --> 09:48.200
These are so...

09:48.200 --> 09:48.910
so precious.

09:48.910 --> 09:49.600
Do we really need

09:49.600 --> 09:51.030
all these expensive herbs?

09:51.030 --> 09:53.320
There are many herbs on this prescription

09:53.320 --> 09:55.250
that you can't buy even with money.

09:55.840 --> 09:56.840
I was thinking of using

09:56.840 --> 09:58.160
some ordinary herbs.

09:58.440 --> 09:59.630
But I

10:00.240 --> 10:01.360
still hope your arrow wound

10:01.360 --> 10:03.160
can heal as quickly as possible.

10:03.510 --> 10:05.360
Since we've already agreed to cooperate,

10:05.360 --> 10:07.390
stop being so hostile toward me.

10:07.720 --> 10:09.080
I'm looking out for you in every way.

10:09.080 --> 10:11.010
Shouldn't you cooperate a little?

10:12.390 --> 10:14.150
Thank you for your consideration.

10:14.150 --> 10:15.250
Look at me now.

10:15.400 --> 10:17.200
Isn't this cooperative enough?

10:18.840 --> 10:19.750
I want to see

10:19.750 --> 10:21.390
what tricks you're playing.

10:22.320 --> 10:23.030
Let's go.

10:24.080 --> 10:25.810
Help my wife into the carriage.

10:26.240 --> 10:26.870
Yes.

10:27.190 --> 10:29.170
[Wutong Mansion]

10:31.170 --> 10:32.360
[Wutong Mansion]

10:45.910 --> 10:49.470
[The Yujing City Streets, Susha Kingdom]

11:07.510 --> 11:08.910
Killer God! Killer God!

11:08.910 --> 11:09.510
Your Highness.

11:09.510 --> 11:10.570
So handsome.

11:12.750 --> 11:13.750
Your Highness.

11:17.980 --> 11:18.510
Who is she?

11:18.510 --> 11:19.360
The woman from Jinxiu.

11:19.360 --> 11:20.150
Yes.

11:24.390 --> 11:25.510
So beautiful.

11:26.320 --> 11:27.510
Killer God of Susha.

11:28.080 --> 11:29.750
How could this woman
from Jinxiu possibly be worthy of

11:29.750 --> 11:31.000
our prince?

11:33.150 --> 11:34.670
Who is that woman?

11:35.440 --> 11:36.510
I heard she was picked up by our prince

11:36.510 --> 11:38.320
from Jinxiu

11:38.390 --> 11:40.150
and taken as his concubine.

11:41.390 --> 11:43.850
How could she
be the concubine of our prince?

11:44.440 --> 11:46.150
A woman from Jinxiu

11:46.170 --> 11:47.510
even dressed in gold and silver

11:47.510 --> 11:49.110
can't display any nobility.

12:00.270 --> 12:01.200
Amazing.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.380
Look at her.

12:02.400 --> 12:03.670
With such crude behavior,

12:03.670 --> 12:04.630
how could she be a royal consort?

12:04.630 --> 12:06.000
How inappropriate!

12:06.030 --> 12:07.290
She truly doesn't deserve our prince.

12:07.290 --> 12:09.530
I knew you wouldn't stay put.

12:16.550 --> 12:18.440
You're parading me through the streets

12:18.440 --> 12:21.440
just to make it known
throughout the city, aren't you?

12:21.630 --> 12:22.480
Your identity

12:22.480 --> 12:24.590
will arouse many people's curiosity.

12:24.590 --> 12:25.440
Instead of making them

12:25.440 --> 12:26.860
rack their brains guessing,

12:26.860 --> 12:29.150
it's better to just let them
see for themselves.

12:29.150 --> 12:30.850
Though my concubine

12:30.880 --> 12:32.920
is no peerless beauty,

12:33.240 --> 12:35.480
she's hardly an ordinary woman.

12:41.510 --> 12:42.790
Let me guess.

12:43.660 --> 12:45.960
You're making such a grand display

12:46.230 --> 12:48.090
to let everyone know

12:49.390 --> 12:51.650
that I, Fu Yixiao, am still alive, right?

12:52.490 --> 12:54.240
You're overthinking, my dear.

12:54.910 --> 12:56.690
I just wanted to show you

12:56.840 --> 12:59.390
the beautiful sights of Yujing City,
that's all.

12:59.390 --> 13:00.920
If you don't tell the truth,

13:01.240 --> 13:02.870
today we'll have

13:02.870 --> 13:05.000
a scene of a wife killing her husband.

13:07.150 --> 13:09.010
Since you've already guessed it,

13:09.150 --> 13:11.050
why bother asking?

13:11.480 --> 13:12.600
You're exposing me

13:12.600 --> 13:13.840
in public

13:14.440 --> 13:16.320
just to use me as bait.

13:17.670 --> 13:19.550
Don't you want to know

13:19.550 --> 13:21.610
who's been following us all this way?

13:26.510 --> 13:27.390
My Lady,

13:27.600 --> 13:29.260
we've arrived at Yujing City.

13:33.270 --> 13:34.630
Ignorant.

13:40.200 --> 13:40.870
My Lady,

13:41.080 --> 13:42.320
the road ahead is blocked.

13:42.320 --> 13:43.850
I don't know what happened.

14:03.080 --> 14:06.280
Anyone bold enough
to collide with the prince's carriage

14:08.480 --> 14:09.790
is no pushover.

14:14.950 --> 14:15.950
Your Highness.

14:16.120 --> 14:17.350
Long time no see.

14:19.960 --> 14:23.000
I thought you were dead outside.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.640
You're still alive.

14:24.870 --> 14:26.470
How could I possibly die?

14:27.000 --> 14:27.840
Right.

14:28.720 --> 14:30.220
The wicked live long.

14:30.440 --> 14:31.240
How could you

14:31.240 --> 14:32.720
die so easily?

14:33.870 --> 14:34.790
Look!

14:34.790 --> 14:36.370
Another handsome man came.

14:36.790 --> 14:39.510
He's the only son of Marquis Murong,

14:39.510 --> 14:40.360
Murong Yao.

14:41.080 --> 14:41.870
It turned out to be

14:41.160 --> 14:44.630
[Murong Yao, the Heir of Marquis Changle]

14:41.870 --> 14:43.870
that dashing young Marquis Murong.

14:43.870 --> 14:45.670
He's truly elegant and refined.

14:45.840 --> 14:46.590
Yes.

14:50.870 --> 14:52.730
Another one coming to bother you.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.730
They're much of a muchness.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.550
Miss, you're a rare beauty,

15:33.550 --> 15:34.550
captivating at first sight.

15:34.550 --> 15:36.200
May I ask your name?

15:36.490 --> 15:38.380
I feel like we've met before.

15:40.750 --> 15:41.800
Now I remember.

15:41.870 --> 15:42.870
It was that night,

15:43.120 --> 15:44.440
definitely that night.

15:44.440 --> 15:45.390
You must be the woman

15:45.390 --> 15:46.270
from my dreams.

15:46.550 --> 15:48.080
Do you know who she is?

15:48.440 --> 15:49.390
I don't care.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.720
When I set my sights on a woman,

15:50.720 --> 15:51.600
no one...

15:58.150 --> 15:59.670
She is my

15:59.910 --> 16:01.440
newly taken concubine.

16:01.790 --> 16:02.510
What?

16:02.600 --> 16:03.670
Your concubine?

16:03.750 --> 16:05.080
You're lying...

16:13.790 --> 16:15.240
She doesn't look like a woman from Yujing.

16:15.240 --> 16:16.120
In this Yujing City,

16:16.120 --> 16:17.120
I should have seen

16:17.120 --> 16:18.520
all the beautiful women.

16:19.600 --> 16:20.440
Don't tell me you picked her up

16:20.440 --> 16:21.840
somewhere along the way?

16:24.270 --> 16:25.390
Enough, Yao.

16:26.510 --> 16:27.630
Enough? What enough?

16:27.630 --> 16:28.630
I'm still angry!

16:28.870 --> 16:30.840
You didn't even tell me you were back.

16:30.840 --> 16:32.080
I heard from others

16:32.080 --> 16:33.510
that you were badly wounded at Pingling.

16:33.510 --> 16:34.080
I came here to

16:34.080 --> 16:35.280
end our brotherhood.

16:35.320 --> 16:36.670
I no longer consider you my brother.

16:36.670 --> 16:38.030
You've been saying that

16:38.030 --> 16:39.360
since we were children.

16:58.430 --> 17:00.630
Didn't you want to end our brotherhood?

17:00.910 --> 17:01.890
Get off my carriage.

17:01.890 --> 17:02.360
What?

17:02.360 --> 17:04.880
Am I not allowed
to ride in your carriage anymore?

17:04.880 --> 17:06.000
Where are you going?

17:06.000 --> 17:07.440
To your mansion.

17:08.440 --> 17:09.849
I must say, you're really something!

17:09.849 --> 17:11.109
Where did you get this?

17:12.790 --> 17:14.550
Marquis Changle is our prince's

17:14.550 --> 17:15.670
childhood friend,

17:15.829 --> 17:17.290
as close as real brothers.

17:18.920 --> 17:21.200
Keep me in mind
when there's something good!

17:21.200 --> 17:21.880
Right?

17:22.960 --> 17:23.920
Excuse me.

17:23.960 --> 17:24.900
Excuse me.

17:24.960 --> 17:25.890
Excuse me.

17:26.030 --> 17:27.069
Excuse me.

17:27.089 --> 17:27.589
Excuse me.

17:27.589 --> 17:29.070
I heard they are close.

17:29.570 --> 17:30.590
Excuse me.

17:32.470 --> 17:33.750
We're friends.

17:35.030 --> 17:36.070
The three or four women around me

17:36.070 --> 17:37.700
are not as good as her.

17:37.920 --> 17:38.640
Yixiao.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.350
Master.

17:42.440 --> 17:43.500
-Master.
-Master.

17:43.500 --> 17:44.470
Miss Yixiao.

17:46.400 --> 17:47.160
Master.

17:47.720 --> 17:48.780
Young Master Ling.

17:48.790 --> 17:49.510
What are you doing here?

17:49.510 --> 17:50.160
Master!

17:50.200 --> 17:51.510
I've brought them here.

17:51.510 --> 17:52.550
Master.

17:53.830 --> 17:54.890
I came to Yujing...

18:01.240 --> 18:02.440
to get herbs.

18:03.200 --> 18:03.920
Master.

18:03.920 --> 18:05.680
Master, I'm Fang.

18:05.830 --> 18:08.350
-Master.
-Master, what's wrong?

18:08.350 --> 18:09.160
What's wrong?

18:09.160 --> 18:10.000
Master.

18:10.920 --> 18:12.480
Master, what's wrong?

18:12.510 --> 18:13.390
Who are you?

18:13.830 --> 18:15.240
-Master.
-Master.

18:15.400 --> 18:16.790
I'm Fang.

18:17.000 --> 18:17.890
Oh no,

18:18.240 --> 18:19.310
I completely forgot

18:19.310 --> 18:19.960
about her memory loss.

18:19.960 --> 18:20.830
Master.

18:21.510 --> 18:25.200
Master.

18:25.350 --> 18:26.000
Get up.

18:26.680 --> 18:27.310
Get up.

18:28.070 --> 18:29.280
Master.

18:29.640 --> 18:31.000
I'm Fang.

18:31.000 --> 18:32.550
Who are you all, anyway?

18:34.240 --> 18:34.920
Master.

18:34.920 --> 18:36.400
Master, we've all been good.

18:36.400 --> 18:37.880
Please don't abandon us.

18:37.880 --> 18:38.640
I'll be good.

18:38.640 --> 18:39.370
Master.

18:41.000 --> 18:41.790
Kids.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.640
You must be tired from your journey.

18:43.640 --> 18:46.240
Why don't we all
go to my mansion and talk there?

18:47.510 --> 18:48.290
Let's go.

18:48.510 --> 18:49.310
Master.

18:50.960 --> 18:53.020
What do you think, Young Master Ling?

18:55.750 --> 18:56.490
Master.

18:56.520 --> 18:57.550
Master.

18:59.000 --> 19:00.240
Master!

19:00.240 --> 19:00.830
Okay.

19:05.000 --> 19:05.720
Master.

19:15.680 --> 19:16.400
Let's go.

19:24.920 --> 19:26.030
Master.

19:27.550 --> 19:29.600
-Master.
-Master.

19:29.620 --> 19:30.590
Master.

19:30.880 --> 19:31.860
Well...

19:33.200 --> 19:33.790
My Lady.

19:34.750 --> 19:36.210
Stop crying, okay?

19:36.400 --> 19:37.920
Your master is just injured

19:37.920 --> 19:39.330
and has lost some memories.

19:39.330 --> 19:40.980
She hasn't forgotten you.

19:41.160 --> 19:42.290
It's just that she can't

19:42.290 --> 19:43.490
recall you right now.

19:43.720 --> 19:44.780
Do you understand?

19:46.200 --> 19:47.340
Don't cry.

19:49.720 --> 19:51.530
You say I'm your master.

19:51.690 --> 19:52.890
Do you have any proof?

19:53.110 --> 19:54.160
No.

19:55.750 --> 19:57.950
Then that's just your one-sided story.

19:57.970 --> 19:58.790
How come I don't remember

19:58.790 --> 20:00.190
taking on any disciples?

20:01.680 --> 20:02.360
Master.

20:02.390 --> 20:03.590
Master.

20:08.270 --> 20:10.640
Alright, stop crying.

20:10.720 --> 20:12.590
Something's wrong with Master.

20:14.940 --> 20:16.090
These children,

20:16.310 --> 20:17.480
would they lie?

20:26.350 --> 20:27.880
Master.

20:31.480 --> 20:32.420
Master.

20:32.510 --> 20:33.960
When you go out,

20:33.980 --> 20:35.480
we always wait at home

20:35.480 --> 20:36.800
for your return.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.160
Ask Nine.

20:38.160 --> 20:39.030
You would ask Ning Fei

20:39.030 --> 20:40.690
to send someone to take care of us.

20:40.690 --> 20:41.920
If you don't believe me,

20:41.920 --> 20:43.510
you can ask Ning Fei.

20:47.400 --> 20:48.440
I don't know this

20:48.440 --> 20:49.750
Ning Fei you're talking about,

20:49.750 --> 20:50.440
nor do I understand

20:50.440 --> 20:51.000
what you're saying.

20:51.000 --> 20:51.570
Master,

20:51.680 --> 20:52.960
don't you even remember

20:52.960 --> 20:54.510
Ning Fei anymore?

20:54.530 --> 20:55.820
You kids,

20:56.200 --> 20:57.960
go back to wherever you came from.

20:57.960 --> 20:58.920
Young Master Ling,

20:58.920 --> 20:59.960
please do me a favor

20:59.960 --> 21:01.490
and send them away quickly.

21:03.000 --> 21:04.660
Where do you want to send them?

21:05.750 --> 21:07.480
Is my grand prince's mansion

21:08.030 --> 21:09.880
not big enough for a few kids?

21:13.160 --> 21:14.090
Don't be afraid.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.900
She doesn't want you, but I do.

21:16.480 --> 21:17.510
I'm not

21:17.510 --> 21:18.880
as cold-hearted as her.

21:19.510 --> 21:21.440
I'd never disown my own disciples.

21:21.750 --> 21:23.880
I won't let you
talk about my master like that.

21:23.880 --> 21:25.510
Say that again if you dare.

21:25.640 --> 21:27.400
I won't allow it either.

21:28.580 --> 21:30.720
That fierce look on your faces

21:31.550 --> 21:33.480
is quite similar to your master's.

21:44.910 --> 21:46.030
You're wasting your time

21:46.030 --> 21:47.590
trying to intimidate me here.

21:47.590 --> 21:49.850
You should eat something first instead.

21:52.880 --> 21:53.640
Master.

21:53.720 --> 21:55.000
Master, wait for me.

21:58.510 --> 21:59.440
The food is here.

21:59.640 --> 22:00.350
Let me

22:00.350 --> 22:01.880
introduce each dish to you.

22:02.310 --> 22:03.960
Crab-stuffed orange from Zhenxiu Pavilion.

22:03.960 --> 22:05.790
Crystal quail slices
from Zuixian Restaurant.

22:05.790 --> 22:07.480
Scallop soup and lychee paste

22:07.510 --> 22:08.270
from Sai Jiangnan Restaurant.

22:08.270 --> 22:09.880
Each one is a signature dish

22:09.880 --> 22:11.590
from the major restaurants in Yujing City.

22:11.590 --> 22:12.270
There's also my home-made

22:12.270 --> 22:13.440
roasted whole lamb.

22:13.550 --> 22:15.200
I'm sure you'll enjoy it.

22:16.410 --> 22:17.410
Help yourselves.

22:17.480 --> 22:18.250
Don't be shy.

22:18.640 --> 22:19.880
Right, don't be shy.

22:20.030 --> 22:21.000
Make yourself at home.

22:21.000 --> 22:21.510
Eat.

22:25.160 --> 22:25.720
Master.

22:28.880 --> 22:29.880
I can do it myself.

22:30.200 --> 22:31.130
Hurry up and eat.

22:31.400 --> 22:32.800
Then leave immediately.

22:39.030 --> 22:40.830
Don't just sit there. Let's eat.

22:41.070 --> 22:42.860
Make yourself at home.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.890
All of these are signature dishes.

22:47.680 --> 22:48.570
Young Marquis,

22:48.880 --> 22:49.480
we have plenty of

22:49.480 --> 22:50.940
wine cups in our mansion.

22:51.160 --> 22:52.550
Your shabby wine cups

22:52.640 --> 22:54.300
are not worthy of my fine wine.

22:56.750 --> 22:58.080
Today we hold this feast

22:58.110 --> 22:59.770
to celebrate Suige's return,

22:59.830 --> 23:01.640
and also to wish Suige and Sister-in-law

23:01.640 --> 23:02.200
a long and happy...

23:02.200 --> 23:03.680
One more word of your nonsense,

23:03.680 --> 23:05.280
and I'll cut out your tongue.

23:06.480 --> 23:07.540
What does she mean?

23:07.640 --> 23:09.240
She's not my sister-in-law?

23:10.830 --> 23:12.510
Miss Yixiao is such a beauty.

23:12.920 --> 23:15.380
How could she
possibly be interested in you?

23:15.480 --> 23:16.480
Come on, Miss Yixiao.

23:16.480 --> 23:18.010
Let me raise my glass to you.

23:24.750 --> 23:26.680
Miss Yixiao doesn't care for wine?

23:37.510 --> 23:38.510
With such spirit,

23:38.510 --> 23:40.040
you're truly captivating.

23:40.350 --> 23:41.700
Since you're not his wife,

23:41.700 --> 23:42.920
Miss Yixiao, why don't you

23:42.920 --> 23:44.720
stay at my mansion with the kids?

23:44.720 --> 23:46.450
I'm a very open-minded person.

23:46.760 --> 23:48.550
I don't care where my friends are from.

23:48.550 --> 23:49.640
If you agree,

23:49.720 --> 23:50.400
my household will have

23:50.400 --> 23:51.240
another dear sister.

23:51.240 --> 23:52.400
It's lively with more people,

23:52.400 --> 23:53.400
unlike his place,

23:53.480 --> 23:54.310
which is so quiet

23:54.310 --> 23:55.570
and full of smelly men.

23:55.590 --> 23:56.650
I actually like it.

23:56.750 --> 23:57.610
It's peaceful.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.790
What about you, miss?

24:12.220 --> 24:13.840
Do you know who she is?

24:15.000 --> 24:16.400
She is from Zhengnian Villa,

24:16.400 --> 24:17.880
Lord Ling's daughter.

24:19.550 --> 24:20.350
My apologies.

24:20.680 --> 24:21.920
I've been terribly rude.

24:21.920 --> 24:24.650
So you're the renowned young physician.

24:24.750 --> 24:25.920
Please forgive my ignorance.

24:25.920 --> 24:26.780
You flatter me.

24:27.540 --> 24:29.160
I left in such a hurry last time

24:29.160 --> 24:30.880
and didn't properly thank you.

24:30.880 --> 24:31.720
I owe it

24:31.720 --> 24:33.160
to your Zhengnian Villa

24:33.200 --> 24:35.460
that my injuries have healed so quickly.

24:35.590 --> 24:37.590
I'll drink first to show my respect.

24:50.440 --> 24:51.210
I'm full.

24:51.510 --> 24:52.570
I'll take my leave.

24:54.750 --> 24:55.810
-Master.
-Master.

24:58.000 --> 24:59.060
Your Highness,

24:59.090 --> 25:00.550
I must also excuse myself.

25:00.550 --> 25:01.440
I need to check

25:01.440 --> 25:02.510
Miss Yixiao's hand injury.

25:02.510 --> 25:04.000
Very well, thank you.

25:07.960 --> 25:09.750
My lamb isn't even fully roasted yet,

25:09.750 --> 25:11.280
and you just let them leave?

25:11.590 --> 25:12.720
She's so unromantic

25:12.830 --> 25:13.760
and unyielding.

25:13.820 --> 25:15.620
All my efforts have been wasted.

25:16.030 --> 25:16.830
I'll eat it.

25:22.110 --> 25:22.640
Don't you remember

25:22.640 --> 25:23.720
those kids?

25:25.200 --> 25:26.400
When they came to Zhengnian Villa

25:26.400 --> 25:27.330
looking for you,

25:27.640 --> 25:28.920
I could tell their concern for you

25:28.920 --> 25:30.050
wasn't pretending.

25:30.960 --> 25:32.270
Are you suspecting that

25:32.270 --> 25:33.270
someone deliberately arranged for them

25:33.270 --> 25:34.330
to get close to you?

25:35.270 --> 25:37.000
Aren't you overthinking this?

25:37.350 --> 25:38.400
Why are you here?

25:39.240 --> 25:40.480
I felt sorry for the kids

25:40.480 --> 25:41.720
walking all the way to find you,

25:41.720 --> 25:43.270
so I wanted to give them a ride.

25:43.270 --> 25:44.420
I planned to take them back to the villa

25:44.420 --> 25:45.310
and settle them in

25:45.310 --> 25:45.830
once they couldn't find you

25:45.830 --> 25:47.030
and gave up hope.

25:47.240 --> 25:48.400
I never imagined I'd encounter you

25:48.400 --> 25:49.260
in Yujing City.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.440
It all happened

25:50.440 --> 25:51.170
so suddenly.

25:52.030 --> 25:52.830
Is that all?

25:53.510 --> 25:54.160
What?

25:54.720 --> 25:55.920
You don't believe me?

25:57.070 --> 25:57.900
Fu Yixiao,

25:58.070 --> 25:58.790
you don't actually think

25:58.790 --> 25:59.400
that Feng Suige and I

25:59.400 --> 26:00.840
are working together, do you?

26:00.840 --> 26:01.960
I went to all the trouble
of asking Mr. Qin

26:01.960 --> 26:03.160
to find your whereabouts,

26:03.160 --> 26:05.270
yet you actually suspect I'd harm you?

26:05.270 --> 26:06.000
Anyway, those kids

26:06.000 --> 26:07.270
have been delivered to you.

26:07.270 --> 26:09.600
Whether you accept them is your business.

26:10.790 --> 26:12.720
Why are you so afraid of Feng Suige?

26:14.110 --> 26:15.640
That's none of your concern.

26:15.640 --> 26:16.550
During the meal just now,

26:16.550 --> 26:18.080
when he offered you a toast,

26:18.390 --> 26:20.190
I could see the fear in your eyes.

26:24.400 --> 26:25.110
The rule that fighting is forbidden

26:25.110 --> 26:26.030
at Zhengnian Villa,

26:26.030 --> 26:27.430
you know about it, right?

26:28.310 --> 26:28.840
Yes, I do.

26:28.970 --> 26:29.640
Since this rule

26:29.640 --> 26:31.350
was established by the two royal families,

26:31.350 --> 26:32.880
no one has ever violated it.

26:34.720 --> 26:36.180
He alone is the exception.

26:51.310 --> 26:52.880
I've never seen anyone

26:52.880 --> 26:54.340
kill so many people.

26:54.480 --> 26:56.510
The entire room was soaked in blood.

26:57.110 --> 26:57.850
It took me

26:57.880 --> 26:59.200
a full ten days to clean that floor

26:59.200 --> 27:00.460
until it was spotless.

27:01.310 --> 27:02.170
He's not human;

27:02.920 --> 27:04.070
he's a demon.

27:04.400 --> 27:06.330
I don't care what you think.

27:06.790 --> 27:09.050
I advise you to stay away from Feng Suige.

27:10.590 --> 27:11.390
I believe you.

27:12.790 --> 27:14.230
Fear cannot be faked.

27:14.720 --> 27:16.350
You're clearly terrified inside,

27:16.350 --> 27:18.210
yet you're still willing to stay.

27:18.440 --> 27:18.960
That's enough to prove

27:18.960 --> 27:20.160
you're a good person.

27:23.240 --> 27:23.960
Yixiao.

27:28.400 --> 27:30.790
Miss Yixiao is actually a female general
from the enemy state?

27:30.790 --> 27:31.790
Then you've got to be careful

27:31.790 --> 27:32.790
staying by her side.

27:32.790 --> 27:34.240
Don't end up worse off than before,

27:34.240 --> 27:35.400
getting yourself hurt again.

27:35.400 --> 27:36.800
That's impossible.

27:36.880 --> 27:38.210
Then what are you after?

27:38.640 --> 27:39.790
She couldn't have secretly

27:39.790 --> 27:40.750
surrendered to you, could she?

27:40.750 --> 27:41.240
Tell me,

27:41.510 --> 27:42.910
how did you win her heart?

27:43.590 --> 27:44.900
Stop prying.

27:45.030 --> 27:45.850
I'm just curious.

27:45.850 --> 27:47.400
Forget it if you won't tell me.

27:47.400 --> 27:49.720
I actually came today for another matter.

27:49.720 --> 27:51.050
I'm here to say goodbye.

27:52.720 --> 27:54.240
His Majesty has sent my father
to guard the North Pass,

27:54.240 --> 27:55.640
and I must accompany him.

27:56.160 --> 27:57.070
But as you know,

27:57.160 --> 27:58.880
I have no interest in court affairs,

27:58.880 --> 28:00.750
and I know nothing about
leading troops into battle.

28:00.750 --> 28:01.830
But I have no choice.

28:01.830 --> 28:03.230
I'm my father's only son.

28:04.030 --> 28:05.230
When will you return?

28:06.110 --> 28:06.590
What?

28:07.200 --> 28:08.120
Don't tell me

28:08.240 --> 28:09.310
you'll miss me?

28:09.790 --> 28:10.790
Get lost quickly!

28:11.070 --> 28:11.790
With you in Yujing City,

28:11.790 --> 28:13.310
I'm annoyed to death all day long.

28:13.310 --> 28:14.480
Annoyed?

28:14.550 --> 28:16.830
Aren't you happy with me here?
Why are you annoyed?

28:16.830 --> 28:18.490
All right, take this with you.

28:18.550 --> 28:20.080
You might need it out there.

28:21.000 --> 28:21.680
That day,

28:22.200 --> 28:22.750
when you went off to war,

28:22.750 --> 28:23.920
I was afraid you'd die out there.

28:23.920 --> 28:25.000
I specifically stole this

28:25.000 --> 28:26.050
from my father.

28:26.240 --> 28:26.840
For that,

28:26.920 --> 28:28.190
I got a severe beating

28:28.350 --> 28:29.310
and was confined for three months.

28:29.310 --> 28:30.200
Three months!

28:30.350 --> 28:31.160
Is that all?

28:31.880 --> 28:33.140
I never used it anyway.

28:33.400 --> 28:34.510
Why don't you take it back

28:34.510 --> 28:35.400
and return it to your father?

28:35.400 --> 28:36.330
Can you really return clothes

28:36.330 --> 28:37.510
after they've been given away?

28:37.510 --> 28:38.240
I don't care.

28:39.310 --> 28:40.240
You, Feng Suige,

28:40.400 --> 28:41.440
owe me a big favor.

28:42.480 --> 28:44.080
How do you want me to repay it?

28:44.270 --> 28:45.930
I'll have to think about that,

28:46.000 --> 28:46.920
but whatever I ask for,

28:46.920 --> 28:47.920
you can't refuse.

28:51.460 --> 28:52.070
Don't worry.

28:52.070 --> 28:52.720
I won't set my sights on

28:52.720 --> 28:53.960
Miss Yixiao.

28:54.510 --> 28:55.400
I'm a man who values

28:55.400 --> 28:56.260
brotherhood,

28:56.440 --> 28:57.300
and would never

28:57.440 --> 28:58.970
steal someone else's love.

28:59.270 --> 29:00.000
I'm leaving.

29:01.000 --> 29:02.400
You really don't want it?

29:02.640 --> 29:03.310
No, I don't.

29:05.790 --> 29:06.400
Lu Ke,

29:07.160 --> 29:08.760
have they shown themselves?

29:09.360 --> 29:09.980
They were about to make a move

29:09.980 --> 29:10.960
on Fu Yixiao at that moment.

29:10.960 --> 29:11.880
Young Marquis

29:11.880 --> 29:13.040
came at just the right time.

29:13.040 --> 29:14.000
Once he showed up with his entourage,

29:14.000 --> 29:15.160
everyone scattered.

29:15.160 --> 29:16.110
But I had Gu Yu and Yun Fang

29:16.110 --> 29:16.880
follow them.

29:17.750 --> 29:18.400
Good.

29:24.400 --> 29:26.000
My Lady talks about you every day.

29:26.000 --> 29:27.720
She came all the way here to see you.

29:27.720 --> 29:29.450
Why are you making her unhappy?

29:31.720 --> 29:32.310
My Lady,

29:32.590 --> 29:34.070
why are you siding with an outsider?

29:34.070 --> 29:35.530
Yixiao isn't an outsider.

29:36.030 --> 29:37.630
She's an ungrateful wretch.

29:40.270 --> 29:42.110
I told her to go get
the medicine box just now

29:42.110 --> 29:43.240
and didn't call her for dinner.

29:43.240 --> 29:44.840
She's mad about it right now.

29:45.160 --> 29:47.270
With the smell of roasted lamb
filling the yard,

29:47.270 --> 29:48.070
someone's stomach must be

29:48.070 --> 29:49.600
growling from hunger, huh?

29:49.790 --> 29:50.440
Not at all!

29:50.960 --> 29:52.160
I'm not hungry at all.

29:54.160 --> 29:55.160
Does it hurt here?

29:55.160 --> 29:56.420
It hurts if I use force,

29:56.920 --> 29:58.720
but otherwise I don't feel much.

29:59.350 --> 30:01.160
From what I can see of your recovery,

30:01.160 --> 30:02.550
you should be fine day to day,

30:02.550 --> 30:04.590
but with this hand injury,
you can't engage in combat.

30:04.590 --> 30:05.310
If you want to regain your former skills

30:05.310 --> 30:06.540
as a top archer,

30:06.640 --> 30:08.440
I'm afraid it'll take some time.

30:08.830 --> 30:09.650
I'm not really sure

30:09.650 --> 30:10.500
if I can fully heal

30:10.500 --> 30:11.500
your hand injury.

30:11.530 --> 30:12.420
But I promise

30:12.680 --> 30:13.830
I'll do my best.

30:14.550 --> 30:15.160
Thank you.

30:20.420 --> 30:22.220
I had them save a lamb leg for you.

30:23.110 --> 30:23.640
Really?

30:24.240 --> 30:25.540
But it's so late now.

30:25.680 --> 30:28.280
Are you sure you still
want to eat roasted lamb?

30:28.680 --> 30:29.690
I'll go eat then.

30:36.470 --> 30:37.480
There are only four.

30:37.480 --> 30:38.960
We've only identified four so far.

30:38.960 --> 30:39.790
They left the city when it got dark

30:39.790 --> 30:41.250
and didn't stay in Yujing.

30:41.440 --> 30:42.900
They're cautious indeed.

30:43.270 --> 30:43.920
Your Highness,

30:43.920 --> 30:45.480
they're definitely not ordinary spies.

30:45.480 --> 30:46.550
As per your instructions,

30:46.550 --> 30:47.510
Gu Yu and I followed them out of the city,

30:47.510 --> 30:48.350
but didn't pursue further,

30:48.350 --> 30:49.440
afraid of alerting them.

30:49.440 --> 30:50.330
Who

30:50.780 --> 30:51.510
do you think

30:51.510 --> 30:52.440
they could be?

30:52.880 --> 30:54.340
Judging by their methods,

30:54.480 --> 30:55.400
they must be Jinxiu secret guards.

30:55.400 --> 30:56.660
Jinxiu secret guards?

30:58.110 --> 30:59.510
They serve under

30:59.510 --> 31:01.000
Prince of Zhennan, Xia Jingshi.

31:01.000 --> 31:02.350
The one seeking to kill Fu Yixiao

31:02.350 --> 31:03.050
is him?

31:03.200 --> 31:03.830
But if he

31:03.830 --> 31:04.550
wanted to kill

31:04.550 --> 31:05.810
a military commander,

31:05.830 --> 31:07.360
would he go to such lengths?

31:08.030 --> 31:09.910
This gets more interesting.

31:10.200 --> 31:11.060
Your Highness,

31:11.270 --> 31:11.730
what are

31:11.750 --> 31:12.920
our next steps?

31:14.860 --> 31:15.960
The more anxious they are

31:15.960 --> 31:17.220
to get rid of Fu Yixiao,

31:17.310 --> 31:19.160
the more it shows that Fu Yixiao

31:19.160 --> 31:20.110
holds a secret

31:20.110 --> 31:21.590
that terrifies them.

31:22.110 --> 31:23.510
We'll stay put on the surface,

31:23.510 --> 31:25.310
but deploy our forces secretly.

31:25.400 --> 31:27.350
They might only get one chance,

31:27.750 --> 31:28.640
and we too

31:28.640 --> 31:30.160
have only one.

31:31.720 --> 31:34.030
We must wipe them out completely.

31:42.110 --> 31:43.110
As Master taught,

31:43.160 --> 31:44.240
of ten parts of skill,

31:44.240 --> 31:45.350
seven come from stance training.

31:45.350 --> 31:47.150
We need to firm up our lower body.

32:15.450 --> 32:16.330
Not bad,

32:17.080 --> 32:18.810
you're practicing quite well.

32:19.400 --> 32:21.130
But just learning horse stance

32:21.290 --> 32:23.490
won't be enough to protect your master.

32:23.500 --> 32:25.160
That's none of your business.

32:26.540 --> 32:28.240
Being cautious around strangers

32:28.240 --> 32:29.060
is also good.

32:29.200 --> 32:31.180
But I'm your master's friend.

32:31.750 --> 32:32.550
I only want

32:32.550 --> 32:33.960
to help you

32:33.960 --> 32:35.690
because you're her disciples.

32:37.440 --> 32:39.440
If you don't appreciate it, so be it.

32:41.200 --> 32:41.740
You!

32:42.130 --> 32:43.530
How do you want to help us?

32:44.310 --> 32:45.910
Follow me if you want to know.

32:47.400 --> 32:48.600
Don't go.

32:48.920 --> 32:49.640
I'll go see

32:49.640 --> 32:50.440
what he can do.

32:50.440 --> 32:51.500
I'll be right back.

32:52.030 --> 32:52.790
Fang!

32:53.240 --> 32:54.240
-Fang!
-Brother.

33:15.030 --> 33:16.200
It is necessary to have effective tools

33:16.200 --> 33:17.200
to do good work.

33:17.350 --> 33:18.550
If you want to master a skill,

33:18.550 --> 33:20.840
you must first choose a suitable weapon.

33:21.310 --> 33:22.440
Just like my master,

33:22.480 --> 33:23.550
she has an incredibly powerful

33:23.550 --> 33:24.680
Moon-Shooting Bow.

33:26.550 --> 33:27.920
You know quite a bit.

33:28.010 --> 33:28.960
Of course.

33:29.110 --> 33:30.790
I've been with my master
since I was little.

33:30.790 --> 33:32.240
I know everything about her.

33:32.240 --> 33:32.790
Really?

33:33.310 --> 33:34.510
I don't believe that.

33:35.070 --> 33:36.270
Why would I lie to you?

33:36.750 --> 33:37.550
Shunzi, Nine

33:37.640 --> 33:38.840
and I are all orphans.

33:39.310 --> 33:40.690
Our fathers and uncles

33:40.790 --> 33:42.590
were the generals of our master.

33:43.510 --> 33:44.870
In the battle at Yazipo,

33:45.310 --> 33:47.000
they all sacrificed their lives.

33:47.000 --> 33:47.510
Later,

33:47.640 --> 33:48.980
our master adopted us.

33:49.640 --> 33:51.680
She taught us martial arts
and swordsmanship,

33:51.680 --> 33:53.390
saying it was for self-protection.

33:53.390 --> 33:54.400
We want to join

33:54.400 --> 33:56.000
the Zhennan Army when we grow up,

33:56.000 --> 33:57.400
but she doesn't approve,

33:57.680 --> 33:59.830
saying that the battlefield is dangerous.

33:59.830 --> 34:01.400
But she herself...

34:02.510 --> 34:03.720
So Yixiao adopted

34:03.720 --> 34:05.780
the children of her fallen comrades.

34:07.880 --> 34:10.280
You're trying to
get information out of me?

34:10.280 --> 34:10.920
Yes.

34:12.150 --> 34:13.550
I am indeed curious about

34:13.630 --> 34:16.090
the connection
between you and your master.

34:24.230 --> 34:24.860
Come on.

34:25.310 --> 34:26.170
This is for you.

34:29.270 --> 34:31.030
Are you really giving this to me?

34:31.030 --> 34:31.820
Of course.

34:32.350 --> 34:33.480
From today onwards,

34:33.630 --> 34:35.510
I am your friend.

34:43.000 --> 34:43.860
Your Highness,

34:46.030 --> 34:48.070
the marriage proposal letter
from Jinxiu has arrived.

34:48.070 --> 34:49.480
His Majesty summons you to the palace.

34:49.480 --> 34:50.540
Marriage proposal?

34:50.540 --> 34:51.739
Who's marrying whom?

34:57.900 --> 35:00.750
[Wutong Mansion]

34:58.630 --> 34:59.490
Your Highness.

35:04.280 --> 35:06.340
-Stop following me.
-Your Highness!

35:08.070 --> 35:08.930
Your Highness!

35:10.840 --> 35:11.400
Oh no!

35:11.400 --> 35:12.340
This is trouble.

35:12.630 --> 35:13.690
We need to stop him.

35:13.710 --> 35:14.070
We can't let him enter the palace

35:14.070 --> 35:14.880
like this to see the Emperor.

35:14.880 --> 35:15.760
Who can stop him?

35:15.760 --> 35:16.320
Looking at him like this,

35:16.320 --> 35:18.360
I'd even believe he'd
burn down the imperial palace!

35:18.360 --> 35:19.030
Gu Yu.

35:19.360 --> 35:20.780
Keep an eye on Fu Yixiao at the mansion.

35:20.780 --> 35:24.540
[Wutong Mansion]

35:21.510 --> 35:22.270
What are you doing?

35:22.270 --> 35:23.400
Assemble the Feng Battalion.

35:23.400 --> 35:24.150
Nonsense!

35:25.440 --> 35:26.360
Do you want everyone to think

35:26.360 --> 35:28.190
His Highness is staging a rebellion?

35:28.190 --> 35:29.050
Are you insane?

35:31.110 --> 35:32.110
His Highness said

35:32.230 --> 35:33.020
no.

35:33.150 --> 35:33.980
Gu Yu.

35:34.130 --> 35:35.590
Gu Yu is right this time.

35:35.630 --> 35:36.320
Let's talk inside.

35:36.320 --> 35:36.960
Don't stop me.

35:36.960 --> 35:38.670
Don't stop me!

35:38.760 --> 35:40.000
Give me back my dagger.

35:40.000 --> 35:41.000
You're a traitor!

35:41.190 --> 35:42.110
You took his stuff,

35:42.110 --> 35:43.230
and you're still holding onto it!

35:43.230 --> 35:44.920
-Let go!
-You're wrongly accusing me.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.400
-He gave it to me.
-Give it to me.

35:46.400 --> 35:48.000
I didn't say anything to him.

35:48.670 --> 35:49.670
You're wrongly accusing me.

35:49.670 --> 35:50.440
Return my dagger!

35:50.440 --> 35:51.280
Give it to me!

35:53.710 --> 35:55.480
This the dagger he gave me.

35:57.150 --> 35:59.080
-Master.
-Are you alright? Get up.

36:03.400 --> 36:04.170
Master.

36:04.280 --> 36:05.400
Feng Suige gave this dagger

36:05.400 --> 36:06.150
to me.

36:06.320 --> 36:07.640
She took it away.

36:07.840 --> 36:08.400
Master,

36:08.420 --> 36:09.420
he's a traitor.

36:09.550 --> 36:11.680
He just insists on having this dagger!

36:18.150 --> 36:18.760
Qin!

36:19.230 --> 36:20.430
Qin, are you alright?

36:20.800 --> 36:21.730
Hang in there.

36:21.750 --> 36:23.000
Hang in there!

36:23.800 --> 36:24.690
General.

36:25.320 --> 36:25.940
My...

36:27.030 --> 36:28.030
My family

36:28.670 --> 36:30.130
has no other members left.

36:30.630 --> 36:32.470
I have only one son,

36:33.110 --> 36:36.400
who is at home in Pingling City.

36:37.230 --> 36:38.030
His name is...

36:38.230 --> 36:39.710
-Fang.
-He's a traitor.

36:39.710 --> 36:40.760
I'm not a traitor.

36:40.920 --> 36:42.440
He gave me this dagger.

36:42.460 --> 36:47.780
-There's a birthmark on his arm.
-It's mine.

37:05.630 --> 37:07.070
Master, I was wrong.

37:10.000 --> 37:11.200
Look straight ahead.

37:11.840 --> 37:12.770
Stand properly.

37:13.190 --> 37:13.820
Throw a punch!

37:13.820 --> 37:14.510
One.

37:15.630 --> 37:16.230
Two.

37:20.800 --> 37:21.480
Yixiao.

37:21.550 --> 37:22.280
Yixiao.

37:23.280 --> 37:25.880
Brother Ning Fei.

37:28.590 --> 37:29.710
Brother Weiran.

37:41.400 --> 37:42.300
Master!

37:42.440 --> 37:43.670
-Master!
-Master!

37:44.000 --> 37:45.930
-Master, don't scare me!
-Master!

37:48.840 --> 37:49.720
Your Majesty.

37:50.000 --> 37:52.070
Now that the war between
our two nations has just ended,

37:52.070 --> 37:54.480
there is deep hatred
between soldiers on both sides.

37:54.480 --> 37:55.960
Without a significant event

37:55.960 --> 37:57.160
to pacify the people,

37:57.440 --> 37:59.550
if conflicts arise again at the border,

37:59.550 --> 38:01.680
I fear both sides will suffer greatly.

38:01.840 --> 38:03.280
Moreover, the marriage alliance

38:03.280 --> 38:04.630
was proposed by Jinxiu,

38:05.030 --> 38:06.360
which clearly shows

38:06.670 --> 38:09.150
their eagerness for peace.

38:14.320 --> 38:16.050
If Jinxiu is so eager for peace,

38:16.320 --> 38:18.070
why don't they send their princess

38:18.070 --> 38:19.400
to marry into our Susha?

38:19.670 --> 38:21.930
Susha has only one princess, Xiyang,

38:22.070 --> 38:24.330
who is His Majesty's precious daughter.

38:24.590 --> 38:25.390
In my opinion,

38:25.550 --> 38:28.210
we must never send
our princess to beg for peace.

38:28.710 --> 38:30.370
How is this begging for peace?

38:30.880 --> 38:33.550
Jinxiu clearly proposed
the marriage alliance,

38:33.550 --> 38:35.670
and they took the initiative
to propose it.

38:35.670 --> 38:38.330
The First Prince
requests an audience outside.

38:43.190 --> 38:43.990
Your Majesty.

38:44.230 --> 38:46.430
The First Prince requests an audience.

38:48.800 --> 38:52.710
Summon the First Prince.

39:19.540 --> 39:21.870
Your Majesty, this son pays his respects.

39:22.320 --> 39:23.280
Rise.

39:23.760 --> 39:25.160
Thank you, Your Majesty.

39:26.440 --> 39:28.070
The Emperor of Jinxiu has sent envoys

39:28.070 --> 39:30.280
with a formal proposal
for a marriage alliance,

39:30.280 --> 39:32.710
requesting that I marry
your sister Princess Xiyang

39:32.710 --> 39:34.800
to the Prince of Zhennan,

39:34.960 --> 39:37.760
in exchange for lasting peace
between our nations

39:37.920 --> 39:39.050
and time to recover.

39:39.070 --> 39:40.070
What do you think?

39:41.230 --> 39:42.280
Your Majesty.

39:42.840 --> 39:44.590
My wounds have mostly healed,

39:45.000 --> 39:47.030
and the Feng Battalion
is ready for battle,

39:47.030 --> 39:48.830
prepared to fight at any moment.

39:51.920 --> 39:52.720
Your Majesty.

39:53.000 --> 39:54.960
Susha has just endured a fierce battle.

39:54.960 --> 39:57.000
Our troops, provisions, and siege weapons

39:57.000 --> 39:58.600
have been greatly depleted.

39:58.670 --> 40:00.180
If we go to war again now,

40:00.400 --> 40:02.690
it will do nothing but harm
to both the state and the people.

40:02.690 --> 40:03.510
I believe

40:03.840 --> 40:05.120
that gaining an opportunity for Susha

40:05.120 --> 40:06.710
to recover and rebuild

40:06.840 --> 40:08.040
is the best strategy.

40:08.960 --> 40:09.870
Moreover,

40:10.920 --> 40:13.070
if the princess truly brings peace

40:13.070 --> 40:14.150
to the people of both nations,

40:14.150 --> 40:16.610
it will indeed be
a blessing for all mankind.

40:20.920 --> 40:23.230
Your Majesty, please think carefully.

40:40.630 --> 40:41.360
How dare you!

40:42.280 --> 40:44.770
What are you doing in court?

40:45.000 --> 40:46.880
Susha has never had

40:46.880 --> 40:49.670
a precedent of sending
a princess for a marriage alliance.

40:49.670 --> 40:51.150
Peace has never been achieved

40:51.150 --> 40:52.840
through humiliation.

40:53.030 --> 40:54.280
Only by fighting for

40:54.280 --> 40:56.000
every inch of our territory

40:57.030 --> 40:58.630
can we speak of true peace.

40:59.440 --> 41:01.240
Jinxiu's proposal for marriage

41:01.400 --> 41:02.660
appears to seek peace,

41:02.710 --> 41:04.170
but is actually an insult.

41:04.360 --> 41:06.590
Not all the men of Susha are dead yet.

41:07.110 --> 41:08.960
I will never use a woman

41:09.800 --> 41:11.590
to exchange for your so-called

41:11.590 --> 41:12.880
recovery.

41:13.480 --> 41:14.150
Enough!

41:16.920 --> 41:19.230
Your Majesty, please calm your anger.

41:27.710 --> 41:29.960
Your desire to
defeat enemies and achieve merit

41:29.960 --> 41:30.960
is commendable.

41:31.590 --> 41:33.150
But in Susha, no one

41:33.150 --> 41:33.840
has ever dared

41:33.840 --> 41:35.670
to shout in the imperial presence!

41:35.670 --> 41:37.550
The civil and military officials
behind you,

41:37.550 --> 41:39.610
are they not all loyal to the country?

41:39.880 --> 41:41.740
Even if there are disagreements,

41:41.920 --> 41:44.000
it's not your place to call for war.

41:46.760 --> 41:47.690
All of you, rise.

41:48.360 --> 41:49.920
Thank you, Your Majesty.

41:54.710 --> 41:55.510
Your Majesty.

41:55.800 --> 41:56.710
I think

41:57.230 --> 41:58.800
the First Prince is right.

42:00.800 --> 42:02.130
Prime Minister Zhuang.

42:02.880 --> 42:04.150
Share your thoughts.

42:04.630 --> 42:06.550
A marriage alliance only
brings temporary peace.

42:06.550 --> 42:08.630
It can never resolve the
deep-seated enmity between our nations.

42:08.630 --> 42:11.030
This marriage proposal comes from Jinxiu.

42:11.110 --> 42:12.440
If we reject it,

42:13.070 --> 42:15.280
they will have reason
to wage war against us.

42:15.280 --> 42:16.960
The First Prince
is brave and skilled in battle,

42:16.960 --> 42:19.030
so naturally he does not fear the enemy.

42:19.030 --> 42:20.590
But years of continuous warfare

42:20.590 --> 42:22.360
have brought
unbearable suffering to our people.

42:22.360 --> 42:24.670
If we collect more provisions for war now,

42:24.670 --> 42:26.230
I fear countless citizens

42:26.710 --> 42:27.960
would have to give up

42:28.000 --> 42:29.860
even their winter food supplies.

42:30.480 --> 42:32.400
I do have an idea.

42:33.480 --> 42:34.670
We can return the four cities

42:34.670 --> 42:37.710
west of Zhennan Pass to Jinxiu.

42:38.590 --> 42:40.910
If Jinxiu reclaims these four cities,

42:40.960 --> 42:43.510
peace between our nations
can be assured for at least three years.

42:43.510 --> 42:44.760
What did you say?

42:45.480 --> 42:46.400
Your Highness.

42:46.810 --> 42:48.400
I am well aware that you shed blood

42:48.400 --> 42:50.660
and fought hard to conquer these cities.

42:50.880 --> 42:52.590
But this is our only option.

42:52.840 --> 42:53.880
For our people,

42:54.200 --> 42:55.590
and for the greater good,

42:55.590 --> 42:57.450
Susha cannot endure another war.

42:59.760 --> 43:01.250
For the princess's sake,

43:01.440 --> 43:04.170
we cannot agree to
the marriage alliance either.

43:08.840 --> 43:09.590
Enough.

43:11.150 --> 43:11.960
Let me

43:12.670 --> 43:13.920
think about it.

43:14.710 --> 43:16.150
Men fight for their country,

43:16.150 --> 43:16.760
and women

43:16.800 --> 43:19.330
can also share in
the burden for their nation.

43:19.480 --> 43:21.410
Inform the princess of this matter

43:21.590 --> 43:23.070
and hear her opinion.

43:23.960 --> 43:24.760
Your Majesty.

43:29.230 --> 43:31.280
The court is adjourned.

43:36.710 --> 43:38.590
We respectfully send Your Majesty off.
